      "id": "menu-help",
      "label": "Help",
      "actionType": "messageBox",
      "message": "ReCtrl — Quick Help\n\nSummon:\n  Double-press Ctrl (within 400ms)\n\nSearch box:\n  Type — filter leaf actions\n  Enter (empty) — recent actions\n  Ctrl+Enter (empty) — menu (JSON first level)\n  Enter on folder — open nested options\n  Esc / Backspace — go up one menu level\n  Up/Down — move selection\n\nTray:\n  Hover icon for tip; right-click → Reload Script after edits\n\nEdit menus in config/searchActions.json (no AHK changes needed).",
